(d) is disabled according to Hukum Syara', and by reasons mentioned in paragraph (a}, (b), (c) or (d) or other reasons, the number of syahid in support of the charge becomes less than four, the charge of zina, zina bil-jabar or liwat against the accused shall remain unproved and the accused shall cease to be liable to hadd punishment, but may be punishable with the punishment as provided under section 69(2), 69(4) or 76(2). and witnesses not liable to qazaf.

